      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we can shorten this TODO comment a little bit. When I first wrote it I wasn\u0027t sure if the same render step would be used for CPU masks. Right now all PathAtlas types use the `CoverageMask` renderer so the comment doesn\u0027t add that much value.\n\nI would probably remove the whole TODO and shorten it to something like this:\n\n    // We currently always use a coverage mask renderer if a `PathAtlas` is\n    // selected.\n\nThis may of course change in the future (for example the sparse mask format we\u0027ve been considering for large paths will definitely require different shaders) but I think we can figure out how to wire that up when we get there.",
